                "loc": "PSA.57"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jab 57",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "(Title)",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.142"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jab 142",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "(Title)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oa woko ki kunnu, ocito i boro got ma tye Adulam. Ka omegine guwinyo pire, ki jo mukene me doggola pa kwarogi, gucito bote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa ki dano ducu ma can odiŋogi ki dano ma gucamo banya, ki dano ma piny oloyogi, gucokke botgi, en odoko ladit ma loyogi, obedo ki dano ma cok romo miya aŋwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oa ki kunnu, ocito i Mijpe ma i lobo Moab. Owaco bot kabaka me Moab ni, “Alegi iwek wora ki maa gubed boti, nio ka abiŋeyo gin ma Lubaŋa bitiyo i koma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owekogi bot kabaka me Moab, ci gubedo kwede i kare ducu ma Daudi tye ka kanne i godi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lanebi Gad dok owaco bot Daudi ni, “Pe ibed ka kanne i godi, A woko, icit i lobo Juda.” Mumiyo Daudi oa woko ki kunnu, ocito i buŋa Keret.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo onoŋo bedo i Gibea, i te yat anaŋa ma i kabedo mutiŋŋe malo. Cen mo ka obedo kunnu ki toŋŋe i ciŋe, kun luticce ducu gucuŋ cok kwede, owinyo ni ginoŋo kom Daudi ki jo ma gitye kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco bot luticce ma gucuŋ i ŋete ni, “Tin wuwiny, wun jo pa Benjamin, Wutamo ni wod pa Yece bimiyo poto me apura bot ŋat acel acel i kinwu, ki poto olok? En biketowu ducu wubedo lulo dano alip nyo lulo dano miya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mumiyo wun ducu wupiro lok i koma? Pe tye ŋat mo mutito bota ni woda ocikke ki wod pa Yece. Pe tye ŋat mo ma cwinye cwer pira. Ŋat mo pe mutitta ni woda orubo cwiny dano ma yam laticca wek oliba, macalo i nino man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.7+1SA.21.8+1SA.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 21.7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jab 52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "(Title)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doeg ma Laedom ogamo doge ki ka ma ocuŋ iye ka ŋet lutic pa Caulo, owacci, “An aye aneno wod pa Yece ka ocito Nob bot Akimelek wod pa Akitub, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci Akimelek openyo dog Rwot pire, dok omiye cam, ki pala lucwan pa Goliac ma Lapiliciti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka ocwalo kwena pi lwoŋo ajwaka Akimelek wod pa Akitub ki ludoggola pa kwarone ducu, gin ajwagi pa Lubaŋa ducu ma gitye i Nob; ci gin ducu gubino bot kabaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo owaco ni, “Doŋ iwiny, in wod pa Akitub.” En ogamo ni, “An atye ene, rwoda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo openye ni, “Piŋo wupiro lok i koma, in ki wod pa Yece, dok imine cam ki pala lucwan, ka ipenyo dog Rwot pire, omiyo obino ka lweny i koma ki ka liba, macalo en tye ka timo i kare-ni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akimelek ogamo dog ka baka ni, “Kabaka, aŋa ma i kin luticci ma lagen macalo Daudi, ma obedo oru bene, dok ladit pa lugwok kwoni, dano ma giworo mada i odi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tin aye tyen mukwono ma apenyo kwede dog Lubaŋa pire? Pe kumeno, ladit kabaka, Pe itam lok mo marac i koma nyo i kom jo me doggola pa kwarona, Pe aŋeyo lok mo wacel i kom lok ma iwaco-ni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka owacce ni, “Ibito ada, Akimelek, in kacel ki jo me doggolawu ducu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci kabaka owaco bot dano ma gigwoke ma gucuŋ cok kwede ni, “Wunek ajwagi pa Rwot woko, pien guribo ciŋgi ki Daudi. Giŋeyo ni olwi woko, ci pe gutito bota.” Ento lutic pa ka baka gukwero gudo kom ajwagi pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka dok owaco bot Doeg ma Laedom ni, “In aye inek ajwagi-ni.” Ci Doeg ma Laedom oneko ajwagi ducu. I nino meno oneko dano pyeraboro wiye abic ma giromo ruko epod me boŋo camanini ma ajwagi pa Lubaŋa giruko-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo dok omiyo gineko dano ducu ma i Nob ma gaŋ pa ajwagi; gityekogi woko ducu ki pala lucwan, co wa ki mon, litino ki litino lukere ma pud dot, kacel ki twoni dyaŋi ki kana ki romi-gu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ŋat acel ki i kin awobe pa Akimelek wod pa Akitub obwot, nyiŋe Abiatar. Oriŋo olubo kor Daudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci otito bote ni, Caulo otyeko neko ajwagi pa Rwot woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco bot Abiatar ni, “Onoŋo yam aŋeyo lokke wa i nino ma aneno Doeg ma Laedom kunnu. I nino-nu yam aniaŋ ni bitito bot Caulo ada. An aye akelo to man i kom doggola pa kwarowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ ibed kweda, pe ilwor, pien ŋat ma mito neka noŋo mito neki bene. Ka ibedo kweda abigwoki maber.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
